[{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/comments/2593550231","html_url":"https://github.com/godotengine/godot/pull/101596#issuecomment-2593550231","issue_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/101596","id":2593550231,"node_id":"IC_kwDOAO6SJc6alm-X","user":{"login":"TCROC","id":24307049,"node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjI0MzA3MDQ5","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/24307049?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/TCROC","html_url":"https://github.com/TCROC","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/TCROC/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/TCROC/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/TCROC/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/TCROC/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/TCROC/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/TCROC/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/TCROC/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/TCROC/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/TCROC/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"created_at":"2025-01-15T17:33:35Z","updated_at":"2025-01-15T17:37:17Z","body":"I discovered the issue because I have a script that emits all child particles when the parent particle emits his finished signal.  As a result, all child particles emit on scene load.\r\n\r\n```py\r\n@tool\r\nextends Node3D\r\nclass_name GPUParticleSubeEmitterGroup3D\r\n\r\nfunc _ready() -> void:\r\n    (get_parent() as GPUParticles3D).finished.connect(on_parent_finished);\r\n\r\nfunc on_parent_finished() -> void:\r\n    for child in get_children():\r\n        child.restart()\r\n        if child is GPUParticles3D:\r\n            child.emitting = true\r\n```\r\n\r\n@QbieShay realized the appropriate fix and I dug in to find the details as to why :)","author_association":"CONTRIBUTOR","reactions":{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/comments/2593550231/reactions","total_count":0,"+1":0,"-1":0,"laugh":0,"hooray":0,"confused":0,"heart":0,"rocket":0,"eyes":0},"performed_via_github_app":null,"minimized":null},{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/comments/2593949076","html_url":"https://github.com/godotengine/godot/pull/101596#issuecomment-2593949076","issue_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/101596","id":2593949076,"node_id":"IC_kwDOAO6SJc6anIWU","user":{"login":"TCROC","id":24307049,"node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjI0MzA3MDQ5","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/24307049?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/TCROC","html_url":"https://github.com/TCROC","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/TCROC/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/TCROC/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/TCROC/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/TCROC/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/TCROC/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/TCROC/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/TCROC/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/TCROC/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/TCROC/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"created_at":"2025-01-15T21:14:16Z","updated_at":"2025-01-15T21:14:16Z","body":"> This is going to need to update the seed still otherwise the one shot particle will look the exact same every time which is a change in behaviour\r\n\r\nMakes sense.  I'll go update it to update the seed","author_association":"CONTRIBUTOR","reactions":{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/comments/2593949076/reactions","total_count":0,"+1":0,"-1":0,"laugh":0,"hooray":0,"confused":0,"heart":0,"rocket":0,"eyes":0},"performed_via_github_app":null,"minimized":null},{"url":"htt